<lb n="9"/>thaatten, etlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seine</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehilffen</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">annder</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">loße</unclear> boeße buoben angeben, auf welche wir
<lb n="11"/>alhie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oberkhait</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">achtung</unclear> zugeben be=
